### Task 20.1 — Middleware exercises
### Run: node exercises/antonyshisia/task-20-1-middleware.js
### Then send these from the REST Client, or use curl.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Exercise 1 — request time
GET {{base}}/api/time

### Exercise 2 — static file
GET {{base}}/hello.txt

### Exercise 2 — JSON body
POST {{base}}/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Middleware",
  "author": "Antony"
}

### Exercise 2 — URL-encoded form body
POST {{base}}/api/echo
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Middleware&author=Antony

### Exercise 3 — protected route, no header (401)
GET {{base}}/api/protected

### Exercise 3 — protected route, with header
GET {{base}}/api/protected
Authorization: Bearer lesson-token

### Exercise 3 — admin route, no header (401)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/status

### Exercise 3 — admin route, with header
GET {{base}}/api/admin/status
Authorization: Bearer lesson-token
